dn't want to nerf too heavily ;)You can join the Wooden Crow Discord if you'd like to chat with the dev directly, and share tips and strategies with other Kings and Queens. Looking for more indie demos?2 Left Thumbs has 3 other games in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:56:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691969","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4050260-1843481262702776","game_id":"steam-4050260","kind":"announcement","title":"THE DEMO IS LIVE","summary":"After some time playtesting, refining and (hopefully) finding all the bugs; the demo for King's Haven is now live! The demo is a limited slice of what the full game will offer in terms of cards, characters, landmarks, bosses and events. If you haven't played yet, or are returning from the playtests, i hope you enjoy the demo! All feedback is encouraged as i continue to improve the game! Oh, and thanks for 1000 wishlists! Very grateful for those of you who found it early and rough, but decided to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T19:17:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702776","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4050260-1833968530889035","game_id":"steam-4050260","kind":"announcement","title":"Strategems Vol. 2","summary":"Today kicks off Strategems Vol. 2 hosted by Goblinz PublishingA digital event focused on strategy and highly replayable titles.Find your next hidden gem, jump into exclusive demos, and explore the best the genre has to offer!You can play the public playtest for King's Haven right here on Steam! And please consider joining the Discord. We'd love to hear your feedback.(Use the \"Join the Playtest\" button, found below the screenshots on the Steam page) A BIG thank you to Goblinz Publishing for inclu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T17:50:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4050260-1831432155578401","game_id":"steam-4050260","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Deckbuilder Fest","summary":"DECKBUILDER FESTToday also kicks off Steam's Deckbuilder Fest!There are nearly 2000 games taking part in this event.A brand new public playtest is LIVE NOW!Click the green \"Join the Playtest\" button on the Steam pageThe best thing you can do to help support any other upcoming games taking part, is to wishlist and/or leave reviews on those pages.MORE GAMES?2 Left Thumbs alone managed to have 11 games including in this event!A few highlights of the event include:The public demo for Decklings. We'd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T18:50:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578401","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4050260-1823825466502050","game_id":"steam-4050260","kind":"announcement","title":"2026 (NEW) Publisher Sale","summary":"Today kicks off the big 2 Left Thumbs Publisher Sale!Explore the full event page to scope out loads of discounts, free games, bundles and more! This post sort of puts the cart before the horse... But as a part of today's event, we are announcing that King's Haven is officially published by 2 Left Thumbs! We've been working quietly behind the scenes to polish the game up for further playtesting.Be sure to Register on the main store page so you don't miss out! NEW RELEASEYesterday saw the release ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-07T18:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466502050","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4050260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4050260":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4050260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z"},"4633500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4050260","app_id":4050260,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b81a5aa6111eaa4731740350e36957ee2ac1d6522e0dd03add78e1f128ec589e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A combo-driven roguelike, where every Citizen is a card in your deck. Draft a Knight, Vampire, Rat King, Chef or over 100 other unique Citizens to chain together powerful synergies. Construct landmarks, survive seasonal threats and defend your Haven in this quirky roguelike deckbuilder.","publishers":[{"name":"2 Left Thumbs","creator_clan_account_id":34486216}],"developers":[{"name":"Wooden Crow","creator_clan_account_id":45835039}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796407200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights"